---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="CN Books end-user license agreement" noindex>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container-x legal-inner">
      <h1>CN Books end-user license agreement</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated November 6, 2026</p>
      <p>CN Books is internal software owned and operated by CatalystNeuro LLC ("CatalystNeuro") for its own bookkeeping. Its only licensed user is CatalystNeuro, acting through its authorized administrators, connected to CatalystNeuro's own QuickBooks Online company.</p>
      <h2>Use</h2>
      <p>CN Books may be used only to manage CatalystNeuro's own accounting records. It is not licensed, sold or offered to any other person or company.</p>
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>CN Books is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. CatalystNeuro reviews the records it creates before relying on them.</p>
      <h2>Termination</h2>
      <p>CatalystNeuro may stop using CN Books at any time by disconnecting it in QuickBooks Online.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:ben.dichter@catalystneuro.com">ben.dichter@catalystneuro.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-inner { max-width: 46rem; padding-block: 3rem 4rem; }
  .legal h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .legal p { margin-top: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .legal .muted { color: var(--color-ink-muted); }
</style>
